    dct:description "`run_model_suite` (L864-908) sweeps the tension anisotropy eps over seven values (SD rises monotonically 9.9 -> 11.8 -> 17.4 -> 25.7 -> 36.1 -> 43.8 -> 51.5 degrees, i.e. eps visibly controls the Fig. 124 distortion), the Lami partition-tension ratio t/T continuously, and contrasts the Plateau limit with the Farhadifar Case I perimeter-contractility comparator; `parse_args` (L1321-1339) exposes --eps-sweep, --lambda-bar, --gamma-bar, --seed, --steps, --n-cells, --bootstrap, --tolerance, --quick and --no-figures. K and the T1 threshold remain module constants." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-parameter-expressivity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
