    dct:description "Deterministic seeds, a `--self-test` (L1267-1319) covering Lami cases, inverse Lami, SHA-256 pins, analytic gradient vs finite difference, T1 three-valence and Euler invariant, determinism and a segmentation smoke test; the default run takes 12 s and writes result.json plus a full metrics JSON that `measure_morphoeval()` (L1216-1265) consumes so MorphoEval measurements are byte-identical to the run. Deductions: no environment lock file for this loop beyond the audit's recorded versions, and the PNG/GIF bytes depend on the Matplotlib version." ;
